      },
      "lineNbr": 349,
      "author": {
        "id": 3702829
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-09T18:17:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we have the iommu_domain_lock lock held, we are protected from domain released under us. I thought of doing it this way so that the domain free succeeds but will wait for this flush to complete before returning domain to the free list in case of a race during domain free.",
      "parentUuid": "67d54a21_9b635d8a",
      "revId": "f61cd346baefda5f6e40c03dde01678520eaf417",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
